  "alternative_titles": "Pungyo ui Yeosin gwa Cheonjae Mangnani Sado-nim, 풍요의 여신과 천재 망나니 사도님, The Goddess of Abundance and Her Troublemaker Apostle, Goddess of Abundance and the Genius Rogue Apostle, Abundance Goddess' Genius Wretched Apostle, The Deity of Abundance and Her Genius Executioner Apostle, The Goddess of Abundance and the Genius and Wretched Apostle, The Goddess of Abundance and the Genius Troublemaker Apostle, สาวกตัวป่วนของเทพีผู้ถูกลืม, 丰饶女神和天才疯批使徒, 豊穣の女神とやりたい放題な天才使徒さま, 豐饒女神與天才使徒, The Rebellious Apostle of the Harvest Goddess",
